syndrome-mitigation-qec demo — NOTICE

This directory (apps/syndrome-mitigation-qec/) is a CPU-only toy
re-implementation of dual-decoder coarse-grained Virtual Error Cancellation
(VEC) in a code-capacity setting. There is NO official code release for the
paper; everything here is an independent re-implementation written for this
demo and is NOT the authors' code.

Paper (attribution, licence CC BY 4.0):
  Oles Shtanko, Saswata Roy, Shashwat Kumar, Zlatko Minev (Google Quantum AI),
  "Measure Now, Mitigate Later: Virtual Error Cancellation for Logical
  Quantum Circuits", arXiv:2610.12400, https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.12400
  Found via a bookmarked X post by @zlatko_minev:
  https://x.com/zlatko_minev/status/2110718095568622016
  No figures or text from the paper are reproduced here; the equations
  re-implemented (Eqs. 2, 9-12, 16-17, S.1-S.9) are cited in README.md and
  config.yaml. Paper-reported numbers quoted for comparison are marked as
  QUOTED and are not claimed as reproduced results.

